          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "صرفه جویی کردن — sarfejuyi kardan — \"to economise\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sarfejuyi kardan pairs sarfejuyi, \"thrift\", with kardan. It is sarfe, \"saving, profit\", with -ju, \"seeking\", and -i. sarfe is usually traced to Arabic ṣarf, \"spending, turning\" (root ṣ-r-f, Lane); -ju is native. kardan, \"to do\", is an inherited verb, from Middle Persian kardan (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
